{"step_index":1971,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:45:21Z","input_tokens":2760,"cache_read_tokens":196131,"output_tokens":2830,"thinking":"The `setupHandlers` function appears to manage UI interactions, specifically toggling business states based on button clicks. It receives properties related to state updates, financial inputs (rates, expenses, taxes), and the overall container element. The core logic likely involves updating the application's internal state in response to user actions.\n\n\nThe handler function sets up event listeners for UI elements. These listeners trigger state updates based on user interactions like button clicks and input changes, updating `isBusinessExpense`, `calcMode`, `annualTurnover`, `digitalShare`, and profit rates. The `onUpdateState` function likely manages state updates triggered by these events.\n\n\nThe handler now includes an input field for operating expenses, updating the application state on input changes. A fetch request is made to an API endpoint that calculates tax advisory data. This involves sending various financial parameters to the endpoint and processing the response.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/TaxAndITRTab.js","Replacement":"function setupHandlers(container, props) {\n  const { \n    state, \n    onUpdateState, \n    verifiedInvoice,\n    calcMode,\n    annualTurnover,\n    digitalShare,\n    digitalRate,\n    cashRate,\n    operatingExpenses,\n    cgst,\n    sgst,\n    igst,\n    totalITC \n  } = props;\n\n  if (!onUpdateState) return;\n\n  const btnYes = container.querySelector(\"#btn-toggle-business-yes\");\n  const btnNo = container.querySelector(\"#btn-toggle-business-no\");\n  if (btnYes) {\n    btnYes.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ isBusinessExpense: true }));\n  }\n  if (btnNo) {\n    btnNo.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ isBusinessExpense: false }));\n  }\n\n  const btn44ad = container.querySelector(\"#btn-scheme-44ad\");\n  const btnRegular = container.querySelector(\"#btn-scheme-regular\");\n  if (btn44ad) {\n    btn44ad.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ calcMode: '44AD' }));\n  }\n  if (btnRegular) {\n    btnRegular.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ calcMode: 'REGULAR' }));\n  }\n\n  const inputTurnover = container.querySelector(\"#input-annual-turnover\");\n  if (inputTurnover) {\n    inputTurnover.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ annualTurnover: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const sliderDigital = container.querySelector(\"#slider-digital-share\");\n  if (sliderDigital) {\n    sliderDigital.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ digitalShare: parseInt(e.target.value, 10) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputDigitalRate = container.querySelector(\"#input-digital-rate\");\n  if (inputDigitalRate) {\n    inputDigitalRate.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ digitalProfitRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0, digitalRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputCashRate = container.querySelector(\"#input-cash-rate\");\n  if (inputCashRate) {\n    inputCashRate.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ cashProfitRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0, cashRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputOpex = container.querySelector(\"#input-operating-expenses\");\n  if (inputOpex) {\n    inputOpex.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ operatingExpenses: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  // Live fetch from FastAPI advisory endpoint\n  fetch(\"/api/tax/calculate-advisory\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n    body: JSON.stringify({\n      calc_mode: calcMode,\n      annual_turnover: annualTurnover,\n      digital_share_percent: digitalShare,\n      digital_profit_rate: digitalRate,\n