{"step_index":1981,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:46:14Z","input_tokens":2629,"cache_read_tokens":204104,"output_tokens":1726,"content":"The **Tax & ITR Filing (Tab 2)** integration with reactive state sharing and backend advisory endpoint has been implemented and verified.\n\n---\n\n### Key Implementations\n\n#### 1. Backend Route & Schema ([`routes/tax_advisory.py`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/routes/tax_advisory.py), [`server.py`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/server.py))\n- **Pydantic Schemas:** Implemented `TaxCalculationRequest` and `TaxCalculationResponse`.\n- **FastAPI Endpoint (`/api/tax/calculate-advisory`):**\n  - **GST ITC Verification:** Sums CGST, SGST, IGST; validates Indian GSTIN format; performs intra vs inter-state determination; supplies Section 16 compliance notes and the statutory 180-day settlement rule.\n  - **ITR Engine:**\n    - Mode `44AD`: Computes digital deemed profit ($6\\%$) and cash deemed profit ($8\\%$), flags Section 44AB tax audit thresholds ($\\ge ₹2\\text{--}3\\text{ Cr}$), and recommends ITR-4 Sugam.\n    - Mode `REGULAR`: Computes net taxable profit as $\\max(0, \\text{Turnover} - \\text{Operating Expenses})$, checks Section 44AB audit requirement ($\\gt ₹1\\text{ Cr}$), and recommends ITR-3.\n  - **Section 87A Full Rebate:** Auto-applies ₹0 tax liability when taxable income is $\\le ₹7,00,000$.\n- **Router Registration:** Registered `tax_router` with `app.include_router(tax_router)` in `server.py`.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. `TaxAndITRTab` Component ([`TaxAndITRTab.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/TaxAndITRTab.js))\n- **Zone 1: Current Invoice ITC:**\n  - Displays Claimable ITC: `₹{isBusinessExpense ? totalITC.toLocaleString('en-IN') : '0.00'}`.\n  - Tax breakdown: `CGST: ₹... | SGST: ₹... | IGST: ₹...`.\n  - Compliance Status: `● 100% Eligible (Sec 16)` vs `Ineligible (Sec 17(5))`.\n  - Resale toggle: `[Yes]` vs `[No (Personal)]`.\n- **Zone 2: Annual Business Planning State (ITR-4 / ITR-3):**\n  - Mode toggle: `Presumptive (Sec 44AD / ITR-4)` vs `Normal P&L (ITR-3)`.\n  - Annual Turnover input (default ₹30,00,000).\n  - Digital / UPI Receipts slider (default 80%) with customizable digital ($6.0\\%$) and cash ($8.0\\%$) profit rates.\n  - Operating expenses input for Normal P&L mode.\n  - Deemed Net Taxable Income & New Tax Regime Section 87A rebate card (`₹0 Full Sec 87A Rebate`).\n  - Asynchronously connects to `/api/tax/calculate-advisory` to stream live statutory compliance notes.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Top-Level Tab Switcher & Reactive State ([`app.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/app.js))\n- **Component Import:** Imported `TaxAndITRTab, { renderTaxAndITRTab } from \"./components/TaxAndITRTab.js\"`.\n- **Active Tab State:**\n  - `this.activeTab = 'audit'` initialized in constructor.\n  - Reset to `'audit'` automatically upon uploading a bill, loading a sample, creating a manual bill, or clicking `← Dashboard`.\n  - `setActiveTab(tab)` updates state and re-renders view.\n- **Top Navigation Switcher Bar:**\n  Placed immediately below the top header and above the main content area with active indicator styling:\n  - Active: `border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600`\n  - Inactive: `border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800`\n- **Conditional Rendering:**\n  - When `activeTab === 'audit'`: Renders the full invoice review workspace (PDF/image preview on left, scorecard on right, GST split controls, and table rows) **100% untouched**.\n  - When `activeTab === 'tax'`: Renders `TaxAndITRTab` inside a responsive container with `verifiedInvoice` data.\n- **Reactive State Sharing:**\n  Any edit in Tab 1 (line-item rates, quantities, CGST/SGST/IGST splits, or preset buttons) updates `this.currentInvoice`, which immediately flows into `verifiedInvoice` in Tab 2, keeping ITC and profit projections synchronized in real time.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n- **Endpoint Test:** `POST /api/tax/calculate-advisory` returned 200 OK with `total_itc: 1980.0`, `taxable_business_income: 192000.0`, `projected_income_tax: 0.0`, `rebate_87a_applied: True`, and `itr_form_suggested: 'ITR-4 (Sugam)'`.\n- **Static Assets:** Verified 200 OK across `/app.js`, `/components/TaxAndITRTab.js`, `/components/ReviewWorkspace.js`, `/utils/taxCalculator.js`, and `/index.html`.\n- **Live Serve